WEBVTT

00:00:01.729 --> 00:00:02.369
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.428 --> 00:00:04.480
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I’ll learn a lot.

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:07.018
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:09.620
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He’ll meet somebody new.

00:00:11.582 --> 00:00:12.329
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:13.395 --> 00:00:14.970
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> You’ll have a good time.

00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:17.599
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:18.636 --> 00:00:19.983
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> She won’t get the job.

00:00:21.997 --> 00:00:22.726
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.451
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> They won’t lend you the money.

00:00:27.403 --> 00:00:28.189
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:29.182 --> 00:00:30.906
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> We won’t arrive on time.